DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_63A3_16CC';
<p>63a3_16cc</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #775900;">Gene C</span></strong> is correlated with the '<span style="color: #775900;"><i>chummy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #775900;">Gene C</span> shows behavior where it always maintains a close distance to other flies.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #006e59;">Gene D</span></strong> is affiliated with the '<span style="color: #006e59;"><i>dewy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #006e59;">Gene D</span> appears moist, with its body covered in tiny droplets of water.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #524bbd;">Gene W</span></strong> is analogous to the '<span style="color: #524bbd;"><i>waxy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #524bbd;">Gene W</span> has a thick protective layer that is water resistant and opague.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">chummy, dewy, waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e9e7ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">42,921</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">chummy, dewy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #524bbd;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">3,848</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">chummy, waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e9e7ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">66,665</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">chummy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #524bbd;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">32,127</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy, waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e9e7ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">31,890</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cbf5e6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #524bbd;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">65,909</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e9e7ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">3,852</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006e59;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #524bbd;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">42,788</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">290,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>C</b> and <b>W</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>C</b> and <b>W</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_63A3_16CC
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_63A3_16CC_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(3,848 + 3,852 + 31,890 + 32,127)</sup>/<sub>290,000</sub> = <sup>71,717</sup>/<sub>290,000</sub> = 0.2473 = <strong>24.73 cM</strong>
LITERAL_63A3_16CC_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_63A3_16CC_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(3,848 + 3,852 + 31,890 + 42,788)</sup>/<sub>290,000</sub> = <sup>82,378</sup>/<sub>290,000</sub> = 0.2841 = <strong>28.41 cM</strong>
LITERAL_63A3_16CC_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_63A3_16CC_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(3,848 + 3,852 + 42,788 + 65,909)</sup>/<sub>290,000</sub> = <sup>116,397</sup>/<sub>290,000</sub> = 0.4014 = <strong>40.14 cM</strong>
LITERAL_63A3_16CC_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_63A3_16CC_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(3,848 + 31,890 + 32,127 + 65,909)</sup>/<sub>290,000</sub> = <sup>133,774</sup>/<sub>290,000</sub> = 0.4613 = <strong>46.13 cM</strong>
LITERAL_63A3_16CC_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_63A3_16CC_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(3,852 + 32,127 + 42,921 + 66,665)</sup>/<sub>290,000</sub> = <sup>145,565</sup>/<sub>290,000</sub> = 0.5019 = <strong>50.19 cM</strong>
LITERAL_63A3_16CC_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_63A3_16CC_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(65,909 + 66,665)</sup>/<sub>290,000</sub> = <sup>132,574</sup>/<sub>290,000</sub> = 0.4572 = <strong>45.72 cM</strong>
LITERAL_63A3_16CC_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_63A3_16CC_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(3,848 + 3,852 + 31,890 + 32,127)</sup>/<sub>290,000</sub> = <sup>71,717</sup>/<sub>290,000</sub> = 0.2473 = <strong>24.73 cM</strong>
LITERAL_63A3_16CC_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

